# Line endings and byte-exact files.
#
# Every text file is checked out LF on both supported hosts, whatever `core.autocrlf` is set to
# locally, so goldens, generated files and hashes do not depend on the host. A T0 step scans tracked
# text files for CR bytes, skipping the `-text` and `binary` paths below.

* text=auto eol=lf

# Byte-exact captures: never normalized in either direction.
tests/raw/** -text

# Binary payloads.
*.elf binary
*.bin binary
*.wav binary
*.png binary
*.snap binary
*.pebundle binary
*.lz4 binary
*.pcap binary
*.btsnoop binary
assets/rom/** binary
# riscv-tests ELFs carry no extension (their names are the test names), so they need their own
# line; they are hash-pinned fixtures (THIRD_PARTY.md).
crates/pemu-rv32/tests/data/riscv-tests/** binary
